  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear each falafel into quarters (don’t worry if they crumble!).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook falafel and green beans, tossing, until falafel is deep golden brown and beans are tender, 4-6 min.\n• Add another drizzle of oil and the seasoning. Toss until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6311bf7bf5cec7edfd095702/step-cae7bf9d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, zap couscous until hot, 2-3 mins.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a bowl, combine mayo and yoghurt",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6311bf7bf5cec7edfd095702/step-881a7743.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To couscous, add spinach and tomato. Toss Plate up couscous, falafel and beans.\n• Spoon over yoghurt dressing. Top with onion chutney and slivered almonds.\n• Tear over dill to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6311bf7bf5cec7edfd095702/step-b343ba6d.jpg"
    }
  ]
